"Desc": {
"DefaultText": "An exclusive item for Sneasel, and Weavile. When kept in the bag, it prevents the Pokémon from fainting to Fighting-type moves, leaving it with 1 HP.",
"LocalTexts": {
"fr": "Un object exclusif à Farfuret et Dimoret. Gardé dans le sac, il empêche le Pokémon de s'évanouir face aux capacités de type Combat, le laissant avec 1 PV.",
"fr-ca": "Un object exclusif pour Sneasel, and Weavile When kept in the bag, it prevents the Pokémon from fainting to Fighting-type moves, leaving it with 1 HP.",
"de": "Ein exklusives Item für Sniebel und Snibunna. Wenn es innerhalb des Beutels getragen wird, verhindert es dem Pokémon KO zu gehen durch Attacken vom Typ Kampf. Es landet somit auf 1 KP.",
"es": "Un objeto exclusivo para Sneasel y Weavile. Al llevarlo en la bolsa impide que el Pokémon se debilite por movimientos de tipo Lucha, dejándolo a 1 PS.",
"pt": "Um item exclusivo para Sneasel, and Weavile. When kept in the bag, it prevents the Pokémon from fainting to Fighting-type moves, leaving it with 1 HP.",
"it": "Uno strumento esclusivo per Sneasel, e Weavile. When kept in the bag, it prevents the Pokémon from fainting to Fighting-type moves, leaving it with 1 HP.",
"ko": "포푸니, 그리고포푸니라에게 한정된 아이템. When kept in the bag, it prevents the Pokémon from fainting to Fighting-type moves, leaving it with 1 HP.",
"ja": "『ニューラそして、マニューラ』のせんようどうぐ。When kept in the bag, it prevents the Pokémon from fainting to Fighting-type moves, leaving it with 1 HP.",
"ja-jp": "『ニューラそして、マニューラ』の専用どうぐ。When kept in the bag, it prevents the Pokémon from fainting to Fighting-type moves, leaving it with 1 HP.",
"zh-hans": "狃拉和玛狃拉的专属道具。放在包里时，可以防止宝可梦在格斗属性招式下倒下，剩下1 HP。"
}
},
